s record: EV-ADVIS-00510-01 (TRAFFIC_ADVISORY) is a MISSING artifact at weight 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, so no closure is asserted or exonerated under POL-RD-03; EV-CHAT-00510 carries zero messages and no waypoint_hint, so no rider-requested detour can be run under POL-RD-04; the trip record shows no pickup or dropoff amendment, so POL-RD-05 does not apply; and the vehicle is RYDE_X with solo_optimal_distance_km null, so POL-RD-12 is out. The trace is clean for policy purposes — 115 fixes at a 10-second interval, 100% coverage, no gaps, max gap 0.0 seconds, weight 1.0 — so POL-RD-07 does not bite and no independent corroboration is needed. The only artifact below weight 1.0 in the bundle is the missing advisory, which carries no fact (its absence alone is citable) and so does not cap confidence; the deciding fact, the fare overage, is carried by EV-FARE-00510 at weight 1.0, and confidence is 0.95, above the 0.70 floor. No POL-RD-10 escalation trigger fires and no clause produces a referral."
